{"id":"647493","name":"鸡蛋炒河粉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647493/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒酱","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"娃娃菜","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"河粉用清水洗净。","img":"images/647493/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"娃娃菜切成小块洗净备用。","img":"images/647493/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"橄榄油下锅变热后打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/647493/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再倒入娃娃菜一起翻炒。","img":"images/647493/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒香后加入盐调味。","img":"images/647493/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入一勺辣椒酱翻炒均匀。","img":"images/647493/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/647493/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入河粉翻炒。","img":"images/647493/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入盐，醋和生抽翻炒均匀。","img":"images/647493/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/647493/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}